  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\n{欠|けつ} (lack, absence) + {勤|きん} (work, service) - being absent from work duty.\n\nUSAGE:\nDistinguished by type:\n- {有給欠勤|ゆうきゅうけっきん} - paid absence\n- ⟦{無断欠勤|むだんけっきん}→無断欠勤：17134_mudankekkin⟧ - unexcused absence\n- {病気欠勤|びょうきけっきん} - sick leave\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {欠勤|けっきん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ - to be absent from work\n- {欠勤届|けっきんとどけ} - absence notification\n- {欠勤|けっきん}{日数|にっすう} - number of absent days\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{出勤|しゅっきん}→出勤：04548_shukkin⟧ - going to work (opposite)\n- ⟦{勤怠|きんたい}→勤怠：07731_kintai⟧ - attendance record",
